            "review_title": "Review at Quán cơm 1967 Garden",
            "review_text": "Ray Ray Ray\nDubai, United Arab Emirates936 contributions\n0\nOverall, would I come back? No.\nOct 2022 • Friends\nOdd restaurant with an old guy lazing on a hammock and grandma washing dishes at what appears to be the only counter area to pay your bill.\n\nI was shuttled to the overflow room since the restaurant was full. Restaurant seems to be one of those places that brings in busloads of tourists who come for cheap fare to stuff their gullets.\n\nOrdered the com tam suon as it’s a dish I regularly enjoy. Egg was dry. Meat resembled something that was cooked in 1967 and left out to rest. … and rest. (-1 point).\n\nNo check up on food after it was delivered and similarly had to get up to pay my bill. (-1 for lack of hospitality).\n\nFinally, the restaurant seems to have a massage shop attached for no discernible reason. Just strange. (-1 point for not being a restaurant).\n\nOverall, would I come back? No.\n\nI martyr myself at these places so you don’t have to.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 9, 2023",
